Short:        Last version of "A68k" by Charlie Gibbs
Author:       Charlie Gibbs
Uploader:     willik bellatlantic net (Willi Kusche)
Type:         dev/asm
Replaces:     a68k271.lzh
Architecture: m68k-amigaos


    This archive is a repackaging of the contents of "a68k271.lzh" on Fred Fish
disk number 521.  It contains all three files that make up the
"dev/asm/a68k271.lzh" currently available on Aminet.  In addition, it contains
all the source files needed to compile the executable.
    I am uploading this archive because I was sure that the current
"a68k271.lzh" available on Aminet already contained the source because the
archive on Aminet had the same name as the archive on Fred Fish disk number
521.  It wasn't until someone responding to my message in the archive
"A68kEnh.lha" made me realize that the current "a68k271.lzh" did not contain
source.
    See "A68kEnh.lha" for the latest version of "A68kN", my attempt to
modernize "A68k".
